A W 0~
great serpent~
the Great Serpent~
The Great Serpent lies here in an immense coil.
~
Golden eyes the size of dinner plates return your gaze unblinkingly, you
find yourself overcome by a feeling of awe and terror. As the forked tongue
of the Great Serpent flickers forth, your able to catch a glimpse of the
monsters mighty fangs, housed in jaws that would have little trouble 
swallowing a mounted knight in full armor. While it is difficult to judge the
full size of the serpent while coiled, it must be literally hundreds of feet
in length... and the powerfull muscles that ripple beneath the monsters thick
scales look like they could squeeze the life out of just about anything.
~
